{"aliases": ["deep dof", "深景深效果"], "applicable_path": "camera.depth_of_field", "candidate_value": "deep", "conditions": [{"operator": "equals", "path": "composition.framing", "values": ["wide_shot"]}, {"operator": "equals", "path": "environment.mode", "values": ["outdoor"]}], "content": "当构图被确认为 wide_shot 且环境为 outdoor 时，景深优先选择 deep：这是项目对户外大范围场景的默认偏好，便于前景、主体与背景同时可辨并保留地点层次，可被用户明确值或 PIN 覆盖。wide_shot 是景别描述，不等于广角焦距，也不规定视角或透视；deep 不代表无限景深，不承诺空间透视准确。仅在 camera.depth_of_field 为用户委托、未 PIN 且无 active Realization 时提议；用户需要浅景深或背景虚化时以用户值为准。", "content_hash": "b32de75822d16f0dc21786543f4422aa8eab24a14869eee07e44636eb9cd1db9", "keywords": ["深景深", "环境可读", "空间层次", "户外", "deep depth of field", "wide shot", "outdoor"], "knowledge_id": "camera.depth_of_field.deep_for_wide_shot", "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-16T10:25:59Z", "reviewer": "change", "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "camera.depth_of_field.deep_for_wide_shot", "original_declaration": "由 v0.4 draft 规则收窄/改写而来的项目原创启发式提案，未复制任何第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "data/staging/rag_resources_20260916/knowledge_review/draft_proposals/camera.depth_of_field.deep_for_wide_shot.v2.json", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.5-draft-proposal-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则（收窄提案）：户外宽景的深景深偏好（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "2"}
{"aliases": ["shallow dof", "浅景深效果"], "applicable_path": "camera.depth_of_field", "candidate_value": "shallow", "conditions": [{"operator": "equals", "path": "composition.framing", "values": ["close_up"]}, {"operator": "equals", "path": "style.primary", "values": ["cinematic"]}], "content": "当构图被确认为 close_up 且风格为 cinematic 时，景深优先选择 shallow：这是项目对近景观感的默认偏好，用于隔离杂乱背景、集中主体视觉权重，可被用户明确值或 PIN 覆盖。浅景深只描述焦外虚化程度，不等于透视压缩，也不改变镜头焦段、视角或空间比例；本规则不声称 close_up 必然浅景深，也不承诺画质提升。仅在 camera.depth_of_field 为用户委托、未 PIN 且无 active Realization 时提议；用户需要环境可读时以用户值为准。", "content_hash": "8124fdd97f82cded4e9dcfbb02e3a4c73c963aa48d19e7c2ba6db70b67d8a6e5", "keywords": ["浅景深", "背景虚化", "特写", "主体隔离", "shallow depth of field", "bokeh", "close-up"], "knowledge_id": "camera.depth_of_field.shallow_for_close_up", "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-16T10:25:59Z", "reviewer": "change", "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "camera.depth_of_field.shallow_for_close_up", "original_declaration": "由 v0.4 draft 规则收窄/改写而来的项目原创启发式提案，未复制任何第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "data/staging/rag_resources_20260916/knowledge_review/draft_proposals/camera.depth_of_field.shallow_for_close_up.v2.json", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.5-draft-proposal-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则（收窄提案）：近景电影感的浅景深偏好（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "2"}
